  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MemcachedOASIS v2.0.3\n\nMemcached OASIS Provider — distributed memory caching system for OASIS holons and avatars via EnyimMemcachedCore. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Integrate verified Memcached native storage lifecycle (d4c95e9)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Recover Memcached and Upstash CQL demo source and launchers (e646390)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.MemcachedOASIS",
